3. Defending the “Seer” Claim: She jumped in to back Player 2’s claim of seeing a wolf last night, even though no one’s seen proof. Innocent villagers would ask questions; she’s too quick to shut them down.
4. No Clear Alibi: Everyone else has tried to piece together night-phase movements; she hasn’t offered a single plausible action or observation.

Taken together, her behavior reads like a wolf’s tactic to sow doubt and shield her pack. I propose we all put our votes on Player 5 right now—if we hit a unanimous vote, we’ll be rid of a likely werewolf and swing momentum in our favor.[00m




